be quite low (say 10% - 40%) considering that about 50-80 users could be
using the Oracle application during this period and ASU shares are also
simiultaneously accessed to launch the Forms or Reports.

I would like to know if the info provided by "System Information" can be
completely trusted or should I also check on some other utility for
available memory space at that time. I would appreciate a feedback on
this in order to determine the amount of memory that can be set aside
for the SGA. Thanks.


